  "description": "Bundle: installs the complete LinKit stack for a service (CQRS, endpoints, background jobs, data access, outbox/inbox, sagas, caching, resilience, tenancy, JSON and generated gRPC adapters) with one PackageReference. Contains no code of its own. Broker clients are intentionally not included.",
  "id": "LinKit.Engine.Microservice",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-21T06:57:00.83Z",
