  "published": "2026-11-21T06:52:53.667Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.1.0: first release. Dependency bundle only - it adds no types of its own and exists so a service can install the whole LinKit stack in one reference. It is LinKit.Engine.Monolith plus LinKit.Grpc, and it ships the LINKITENGINE001 build guard, which warns when the bundle is mixed with individual LinKit packages because a direct reference overrides the version the bundle supplies. LinKit.Messaging.Kafka and LinKit.Messaging.RabbitMQ are deliberately excluded: add the one your service actually publishes to. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
